.TH TOGGLY-AUTH 1 "2026-10-03" "Toggly CLI" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
toggly-auth \- Manage interactive authentication
.SH SYNOPSIS
toggly\-cli auth <command>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage interactive authentication
.SS login
Log in with the OAuth2 device\-code flow\&. Stores the session in the OS
credential store (macOS Keychain, Windows Credential Manager, or Linux
libsecret)\&.
.PP
.B toggly\-cli auth login [options]
.SS logout
Remove the stored device\-code session from the OS credential store\&.
.PP
.B toggly\-cli auth logout
.SS status
Show whether a device\-code session is stored\&. Never prints access or
refresh tokens\&.
.PP
.B toggly\-cli auth status
.SH OPTIONS
Options for auth login:
.TP
.B \-\-authority
OAuth2 authority URL (defaults to https://auth\&.toggly\&.io)
.TP
.B \-\-client\-id
Public device client id (defaults to toggly\-cli)
.TP
.B \-\-scopes
OAuth scopes (defaults to 'openid toggly offline_access')
.PP
